msgid "Zda pacient participoval ve výzkumu nebo studii. Lze rozlišit observační/intervenční (rozšíření možné později)."
msgstr "Whether the patient is enrolled in any active research protocol or clinical trial.\n\nThis data element is Not Mandatory\n\nThe recommended data standard is Value Set: Yes No Unknown Not Asked\n•\thttps://terminology.hl7.org/7.0.1/ValueSet-yes-no-unknown-not-asked.html\n"

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.LogResearchCz.vyzkum.souhlasKontaktVyzkum/short
msgid "Souhlas s kontaktováním"
msgstr "11.2 Agreement to Be Contacted for Protocol"

# Provides a complete explanation of the meaning of the data element for human readability.  For the case of elements derived from existing elements (e.g. constraints), the definition SHALL be consistent with the base definition, but convey the meaning of the element in the particular context of use of the resource. (Note: The text you are reading is specified in ElementDefinition.definition).
#: StructureDefinition.element.LogResearchCz.vyzkum.souhlasKontaktVyzkum/definition
msgid "Zda pacient souhlasil s kontaktováním pro účely výzkumu. Hodnoty: Yes / No / Unknown / Not Asked."
msgstr "Patient’s consent / agreement to be contacted in the future for clinical research opportunities related to their rare disease\n\nThis data element is Mandatory\n\nThe recommended data standard is Value Set: Yes No Unknown Not Asked\n•\thttps://terminology.hl7.org/7.0.1/ValueSet-yes-no-unknown-not-asked.html"

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.LogResearchCz.vyzkum.biologickyVzorekKDispozici/short
msgid "Biologický vzorek k dispozici"
msgstr "11.3 Patient Having Previously Given Biosample for Research"

# Provides a complete explanation of the meaning of the data element for human readability.  For the case of elements derived from existing elements (e.g. constraints), the definition SHALL be consistent with the base definition, but convey the meaning of the element in the particular context of use of the resource. (Note: The text you are reading is specified in ElementDefinition.definition).
#: StructureDefinition.element.LogResearchCz.vyzkum.biologickyVzorekKDispozici/definition
msgid "Zda je biologický vzorek pacienta dostupný pro výzkumné účely."
msgstr "Whether the patient has previously donated biosamples (blood, tissue, DNA, etc.) for research purposes. Allows to develop a biobanking history and determine sample availability for the patient.\n\nThis data element is Not Mandatory\n\nThe recommended data standard is Value Set: Yes No Unknown Not Asked\n•\thttps://terminology.hl7.org/7.0.1/ValueSet-yes-no-unknown-not-asked.html"

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.LogResearchCz.vyzkum.biologickyVzorekBiobanka/short
msgid "Vzorek uložen v biobance"
msgstr "11.4 Biosample in a biobank"

# Provides a complete explanation of the meaning of the data element for human readability.  For the case of elements derived from existing elements (e.g. constraints), the definition SHALL be consistent with the base definition, but convey the meaning of the element in the particular context of use of the resource. (Note: The text you are reading is specified in ElementDefinition.definition).
#: StructureDefinition.element.LogResearchCz.vyzkum.biologickyVzorekBiobanka/definition
msgid "Položka 11.4: český název zdroje znamená vzorek v biobance, anglický název a definice vzorek pro molekulární diagnostiku. Původní název prvku je zachován, význam je nutné vyjasnit. Hodnoty: Yes / No / Unknown / Not Asked."
msgstr "The Czech source name refers to a biobank sample; the English name and definition refer to a sample for molecular diagnosis. The existing element name is retained pending clarification. Values: Yes / No / Unknown / Not Asked."

